<title>USA: Oakdale H&amp;RA, Minn., $1.610 mln won by Piper.</title>
<headline>Oakdale H&amp;RA, Minn., $1.610 mln won by Piper.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it won $1.610 million of Oakdale Housing and Redevelopment Auth., Minn., lease revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.20 percent.</p>
</text>
